        <activityName xml:lang="en">Case, for smartphone, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Case, for smartphone, at plant
The data set represents the production of smartphone case; UUID: 479ba9f8-944a-3b29-a97a-4d7978d790de
The dataset for smartphone case is modeled as a mix of silicone and leather. The assembly efforts are included, as well energy for shaping the materials.
Location: Data for global average case for smartphone
Technology: The case is made of silicone and leather, standard materials.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: unknown
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: Average technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_479ba9f8-944a-3b29-a97a-4d7978d790de.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
